# Optional local overrides for NEMESIS / fart-button host builds.
# Copy to `.env` for your own notes; Makefiles read shell env vars, not this file automatically.
# Export in your shell or IDE terminal profile as needed.

# Android NDK r21e root (native/Makefile)
# NDK=$HOME/android-ndk-r21e

# android.jar for Manager / engine_sound APK builds
# ANDROID_JAR=/usr/lib/android-sdk/platforms/android-30/android.jar

# Optional QEMU Gen5W lab (not published with the repo)
# NEMESIS_EMU_DIR=

# Build-tool overrides if not on PATH
# AAPT=aapt
# D8=d8
# ZIPALIGN=zipalign
# JAVAC=javac
# JARSIGNER=jarsigner
